{"id": "7dbbbb9e-2c0f-4dfe-9bbd-c1a47c089893", "slug": "sylvan-things-botanical-lifestyle", "title": "Sylvan Things — Botanical Lifestyle", "description": "Sylvan Things Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Sylvan Things — Botanical Lifestyle\"\ndescription: \"Sylvan Things Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F3F6F3\"\n  secondary: \"#0E2116\"\n  accent: \"#2A4E35\"\n  background: \"#EBEDE9\"\n  surface: \"#F3F6F3\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"DM Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Sylvan Things — Botanical Lifestyle\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 5; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nSylvan Things Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nSylvan things In the silence of the woods, the simple wisdom of slow growth guides our every creation. Clara Thorne Lead Botanist & Founder Sylvan The Elements For Mindful Forest Living things An Organic Atelier Formula…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Seasonal remedies; Fernwood Elixir; Mosswood Soak; Lichen Balm.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F3F6F3, secondary #0E2116, accent #2A4E35, background #EBEDE9, surface #F3F6F3, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse DM Sans for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Sylvan Things — Botanical Lifestyle</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/build/three.min.js\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,300;0,500;1,300;1,500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#ebede9] text-[#f3f6f3] antialiased overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\">\n\n  <!-- WebGL Canvas Scoped to Left Panel -->\n  <canvas id=\"webgl\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"z-index: 0; opacity: 0.35; mix-blend-mode: overlay;\"></canvas>\n\n  <main class=\"relative z-10\">\n\n    <!-- HERO / REFERENCE SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-stretch overflow-hidden\">\n\n      <!-- LEFT PANEL -->\n      <div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-1/2 bg-[#0e2116] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden min-h-[700px] lg:min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- WebGL Anchor -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\" id=\"webgl-wrap\">\n          <canvas id=\"panel-webgl\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"opacity: 0.45; mix-blend-mode: overlay;\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Branding -->\n        <div class=\"absolute left-8 lg:left-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 lg:gap-6\" data-animate=\"element\">\n          <span class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-medium tracking-tight\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-lr; text-orientation: mixed; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; line-height: 0.9;\">Sylvan</span>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#f3f6f3]/70\" style=\"width: 40px; height: 2px;\"></div>\n          <span class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-7xl lg:text-8xl tracking-tight\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-lr; text-orientation: mixed; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; line-height: 0.9;\">things</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Quote -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-16 lg:top-24 left-[40%] lg:left-[45%] max-w-[260px]\">\n          <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/90 text-base lg:text-lg italic leading-relaxed\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" data-animate=\"words\">\n            In the silence of the woods, the simple wisdom of slow growth guides our every creation.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Founder -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-12 right-12 text-right\" data-animate=\"element\">\n          <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] font-medium text-sm\">Clara Thorne</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1\">Lead Botanist &amp; Founder</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Green Pattern Card -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[10%] top-[18%] w-[55%] h-[72%] bg-[#2a4e35] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\" style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 1px solid rgba(243,246,243,0.15);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n          <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-15\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <defs>\n              <pattern id=\"waves\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                <path d=\"M0 8 Q 7.5 0, 15 8 T 30 8\" stroke=\"#0e2116\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"></path>\n              </pattern>\n            </defs>\n            <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#waves)\"></rect>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- RIGHT PANEL -->\n      <div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-1/2 bg-[#dfe5e0] overflow-hidden min-h-[700px] lg:min-h-screen flex items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Background Image -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n          <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252177539-e136f0ed-6f6f-4b66-a8c5-ab30e2b7087f.png\" alt=\"Mood interior\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50\" style=\"filter: grayscale(40%) sepia(5%) hue-rotate(50deg);\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252177539-e136f0ed-6f6f-4b66-a8c5-ab30e2b7087f.png\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0a180f]/50\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Content -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex flex-col justify-center p-6 lg:p-12 gap-4\">\n\n          <!-- Top Card -->\n          <div class=\"relative bg-[#0a180f] p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(243,246,243,0.08);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\">Sylvan</span>\n            <div class=\"hidden sm:flex flex-col items-center pb-1\">\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest leading-tight text-center\">\n                The Elements<br>For Mindful Forest Living\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-4xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic;\">things</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Bottom Card -->\n          <div class=\"relative bg-[#0a180f]/95 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 lg:p-10 overflow-hidden\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(243,246,243,0.08);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n\n            <!-- Geometric X -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 text-[#f3f6f3]/[0.03] pointer-events-none\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" viewBox=\"0 0 280 280\" fill=\"none\">\n              <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"36\"></line>\n              <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"36\"></line>\n            </svg>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/80 text-xs lg:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 leading-relaxed\">\n                An Organic Atelier Formulating Oils, Forest Elixirs, and Restorative Rituals\n              </p>\n\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 mb-10 text-xs lg:text-sm text-[#f3f6f3]/70 font-medium\">\n                <p>ESTABLISHED <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; color: rgba(243,246,242,0.9);\">by</span> CLARA THORNE</p>\n                <p>HARVESTED <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; color: rgba(243,246,242,0.9);\">in</span> OREGON &amp; VERMONT</p>\n                <p>CRAFTED <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; color: rgba(243,246,242,0.9);\">for</span> INTENTIONAL BOTANICAL LIVING</p>\n              </div>\n\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/90 italic mb-10 text-lg lg:text-xl\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">\n                The elements for a naturally wild existence\n              </p>\n\n              <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                <!-- Primary Gradient Border Button -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(243,246,243,0.9), rgba(42,78,53,0.7), rgba(243,246,243,0.3)); padding: 1px; border-radius: 9999px;\">\n                  <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#0a180f] px-6 lg:px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-[#f3f6f3] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent group-hover:backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                    Shop Botanicals\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </span>\n                </a>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Gradient Border Button -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(243,246,243,0.25), rgba(243,246,243,0.05)); padding: 1px; border-radius: 9999px;\">\n                  <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#0a180f] px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-[#f3f6f3]/70 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-[#f3f6f3]\">\n                    Our Roots\n                  </span>\n                </a>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[#f3f6f3]/10\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hover:text-[#f3f6f3] transition-colors duration-300\">\n                  www.sylvanthings.co\n                </a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ESSENTIALS SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"relative bg-[#ebede9] py-24 lg:py-32 px-6 lg:px-12\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n        <div class=\"mb-16 lg:mb-24\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-[#0e2116] text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight\" data-animate=\"words\" style=\"font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\">\n            Seasonal <span style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic;\">remedies</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"text-[#0e2116]/60 mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest max-w-md leading-relaxed\" data-animate=\"element\">\n            Artisanal skincare and botanical preparations for the modern minimalist.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n          <!-- Product 1 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative bg-[#0e2116] overflow-hidden\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(14,33,22,0.1);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n            <div class=\"aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#dfe5e0]\">\n              <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252204297-1b31faf1-69b8-44b0-9527-3a1d8b270473.png\" alt=\"Botanical Serum\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"filter: grayscale(15%) sepia(10%) hue-rotate(40deg);\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252204297-1b31faf1-69b8-44b0-9527-3a1d8b270473.png\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-6\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Fernwood Elixir</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Forest Apothecary</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Product 2 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative bg-[#0e2116] overflow-hidden\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(14,33,22,0.1);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n            <div class=\"aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#dfe5e0]\">\n              <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252231752-e279fbe2-7497-45db-b512-ed963bc4e88d.png\" alt=\"Mineral Bath\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"filter: grayscale(15%) sepia(10%) hue-rotate(40deg);\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252231752-e279fbe2-7497-45db-b512-ed963bc4e88d.png\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-6\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Mosswood Soak</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Sylvan Baths</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Product 3 -->\n          <div class=\"group relative bg-[#0e2116] overflow-hidden\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(14,33,22,0.1);\" data-animate=\"element\">\n            <div class=\"aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#dfe5e0]\">\n              <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252259293-b67493f2-f3ce-44e9-9b24-fbaf482269d3.png\" alt=\"Silk Set\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"filter: grayscale(15%) sepia(10%) hue-rotate(40deg);\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252259293-b67493f2-f3ce-44e9-9b24-fbaf482269d3.png\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-6\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-[#f3f6f3] text-lg font-medium tracking-tight\">Lichen Balm</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Botanical Care</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PHILOSOPHY SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"relative bg-[#0a180f] py-24 lg:py-40 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden\">\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\">\n        <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252278031-643a944e-75d8-4d4b-89d7-6bf30f55c986.png\" alt=\"Atmosphere\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" style=\"filter: grayscale(40%) sepia(20%) hue-rotate(50deg);\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779252278031-643a944e-75d8-4d4b-89d7-6bf30f55c986.png\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\">\n        <svg class=\"mx-auto mb-10 text-[#f3f6f3]/10\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\">\n          <rect width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"24\" fill=\"currentColor\"></rect>\n          <path d=\"M18 32V18h4v14h-4zm8 0V18h3c2 0 4 1 4 3s-2 3-4 3h-3v8h-4zm3-10h2c.5 0 1-.5 1-1s-.5-1-1-1h-2v2z\" fill=\"#0a180f\"></path>\n        </svg>\n        <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/90 text-xl lg:text-3xl italic leading-relaxed mb-8\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\" data-animate=\"words\">\n          Against the rush of the modern day, we root ourselves in nature's patient pace. Each infusion is slowly matured to heal both body and spirit.\n        </p>\n        <div data-animate=\"element\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(243,246,243,0.5), rgba(42,78,53,0.3)); padding: 1px; border-radius: 9999px;\">\n            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#0a180f] px-8 py-3 rounded-full text-[#f3f6f3] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-500 group-hover:bg-transparent\">\n              Read Our Philosophy\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#0e2116] py-16 lg:py-20 px-6 lg:px-12\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row justify-between items-start lg:items-end gap-12\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/40 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\">Nurturing the Rituals of Slow Green Living</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[#f3f6f3]/90 text-xs\">© 2027 Sylvan Things. All rights reserved.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 text-[#f3f6f3]/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#f3f6f3] transition-colors duration-300\">Instagram</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#f3f6f3] transition-colors duration-300\">Newsletter</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[#f3f6f3] transition-colors duration-300\">Contact</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      // Word-by-word reveal preparation\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-animate=\"words\"]').forEach(el => {\n        const text = el.textContent.trim();\n        if (!text) return;\n        const words = text.split(/\\s+/);\n        el.innerHTML = '';\n        words.forEach((word, i) => {\n          const outer = document.createElement('span');\n          outer.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          outer.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n          outer.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n          const inner = document.createElement('span');\n          inner.textContent = word;\n          inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          inner.style.transitionProperty = 'opacity, transform, filter';\n          inner.style.transitionDuration = '800ms';\n          inner.style.transitionTimingFunction = 'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n          inner.style.opacity = '0';\n          inner.style.transform = 'translateY(30px)';\n          inner.style.filter = 'blur(6px)';\n          inner.dataset.delay = String((i + 1) * 75);\n          outer.appendChild(inner);\n          el.appendChild(outer);\n          if (i < words.length - 1) {\n            const space = document.createElement('span');\n            space.innerHTML = '&nbsp;';\n            space.style.display = 'inline-block';\n            space.style.width = '0.25em';\n            el.appendChild(space);\n          }\n        });\n      });\n\n      // Element reveal preparation\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-animate=\"element\"]').forEach(el => {\n        if (el.getAttribute('data-animate') !== 'element') return;\n        el.style.transitionProperty = 'opacity, transform, filter';\n        el.style.transitionDuration = '1000ms';\n        el.style.transitionTimingFunction = 'cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)';\n        if (!el.style.opacity) el.style.opacity = '0';\n        if (!el.style.transform) el.style.transform = 'translateY(40px)';\n        if (!el.style.filter) el.style.filter = 'blur(8px)';\n      });\n\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n        entries.forEach(entry => {\n          if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;\n          const target = entry.target;\n          const type = target.getAttribute('data-animate');\n          if (type === 'words') {\n            target.querySelectorAll('span > span').forEach(inner => {\n              if (!inner.dataset.delay) return;\n              setTimeout(() => {\n                inner.style.opacity = '1';\n                inner.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                inner.style.filter = 'blur(0)';\n              }, parseInt(inner.dataset.delay));\n            });\n          } else if (type === 'element') {\n            target.style.opacity = '1';\n            target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n            target.style.filter = 'blur(0)';\n          }\n          observer.unobserve(target);\n        });\n      }, { threshold: 0.12 });\n\n      document.querySelectorAll('[data-animate]').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n\n      // WebGL Noise Shader for Left Panel\n      (function initPanelWebGL() {\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('panel-webgl');\n        if (!canvas || typeof THREE === 'undefined') return;\n        const parent = canvas.parentElement;\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n        function resize() {\n          const w = parent.clientWidth;\n          const h = parent.clientHeight;\n          renderer.setSize(w, h);\n          renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n          camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n        }\n        resize();\n        const vertexShader = `\n          varying vec2 vUv;\n          void main() {\n            vUv = uv;\n            gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n          }\n        `;\n        const fragmentShader = `\n          precision mediump float;\n          varying vec2 vUv;\n          uniform float uTime;\n          vec3 permute(vec3 x) { return mod(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x, 289.0); }\n          float snoise(vec2 v){\n            const vec4 C = vec4(0.211324865405187, 0.366025403784439, -0.577350269189626, 0.024390243902439);\n            vec2 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yy));\n            vec2 x0 = v - i + dot(i, C.xx);\n            vec2 i1 = (x0.x > x0.y) ? vec2(1.0, 0.0) : vec2(0.0, 1.0);\n            vec4 x12 = x0.xyxy + C.xxzz;\n            x12.xy -= i1;\n            i = mod(i, 289.0);\n            vec3 p = permute(permute(i.y + vec3(0.0, i1.y, 1.0)) + i.x + vec3(0.0, i1.x, 1.0));\n            vec3 m = max(0.5 - vec3(dot(x0,x0), dot(x12.xy,x12.xy), dot(x12.zw,x12.zw)), 0.0);\n            m = m*m; m = m*m;\n            vec3 x = 2.0 * fract(p * C.www) - 1.0;\n            vec3 h = abs(x) - 0.5;\n            vec3 ox = floor(x + 0.5);\n            vec3 a0 = x - ox;\n            m *= 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * (a0*a0 + h*h);\n            vec3 g;\n            g.x  = a0.x  * x0.x  + h.x  * x0.y;\n            g.yz = a0.yz * x12.xz + h.yz * x12.yw;\n            return 130.0 * dot(m, g);\n          }\n          void main() {\n            vec2 uv = vUv;\n            float n1 = snoise(uv * 3.0 + uTime * 0.04);\n            float n2 = snoise(uv * 5.0 - uTime * 0.06);\n            vec3 c1 = vec3(0.05, 0.13, 0.09);\n            vec3 c2 = vec3(0.02, 0.08, 0.05);\n            float m = (n1 + n2) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n            vec3 color = mix(c2, c1, m);\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n          }\n        `;\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n          vertexShader,\n          fragmentShader,\n          uniforms: { uTime: { value: 0 } }\n        });\n        scene.add(new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material));\n        function animate() {\n          material.uniforms.uTime.value += 0.01;\n          renderer.render(scene, camera);\n          requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n        animate();\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n      })();\n    });\n  </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "sylvan-things-botanical-lifestyle.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/sylvan-things-botanical-lifestyle.jpg", "source_name": "sylvan-things-botanical-lifestyle-DESIGN.md", "views": 38, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T13:58:25.446742+00:00"}